  "intro_html": "<p>The wide Rossberg, the highest peak of the canton of Zug, has its highest elevation on Wildspitz, where a popular inn is located. From all sides numerous trails go up to the ridge. On this tour you hardly ever hike alone. However, there are some less popular itineraries. Two of them, one for the ascent, one for the descent, are presented here.</p>",
